{"id":"c2ee0d48-a5fd-4097-bf9f-e725196d168b","object":"chat.completion","created":1795095413,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"SELECT COUNT(*) AS undelivered_orders_count\nFROM orders\nWHERE order_delivered_customer_date IS NULL;","reasoning_content":"用户问：还没有送达客户的订单有多少笔？\n\n即 orders.order_delivered_customer_date IS NULL 的订单数。计数按订单主键去重（单表，COUNT(*) 即可）。\n\n需要 LIMIT? 硬性规则3：单行无GROUP BY的COUNT除外，不需LIMIT。\n\n输出：SELECT COUNT(*) AS ... FROM orders WHERE order_delivered_customer_date IS NULL;\n\n不要加额外过滤（不排除取消订单）。就是送达时间为空。\n\n别名用中文？用英文吧。用 not_delivered_orders 或 cnt。用 AS undelivered_orders_count。中文别名也可，但保持简单。\n\n是否需要考虑 order_status？规则7：不得擅加过滤。所以只按 delivered_customer_date IS NULL。"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":3573,"completion_tokens":185,"total_tokens":3758,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1792},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":159},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1792,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":1781},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}